{"title":"2020 AMC 8 Problems/em 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/em_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Four friends do yardwork for their neighbors over the weekend, earning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/e/40e538d1a5fbfc50942e89baa7a50351eaad7aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$15, \\$20, \\$25,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b47f2b1eb372398a82c21d9e7575e136e4d8ee0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$40,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"34\" height=\"19\" /> respectively. They decide to split their earnings equally among themselves. In total how much will the friend who earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae7a6304da716110d548a4dc8944c3d41eae0f38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> give to the others?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/em_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the amount of sugar is twice the amount of lemon juice, Luka uses <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab8719adf30b98aa8ed28d1b5da5fec0259c2bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot2=6$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> cups of sugar.\n</p><p>Since the amount of water is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the amount of sugar, he uses <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/3/c5331d2452aa27873e27551b1af51351a18b3eb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot4=\\boxed{\\text{(E) }24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" /> cups of water.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/em_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8\" title=\"2020 AMC 8\">2020 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" titl